STATEMENT OF MODIFICATIONS
--------------------------

The following modifications have been made to the original work. Dates refer
to the date the change was made.

2026-09-23
  * All storage-root resolution was unified into a single component
    (components/helpers/storage/StorageRoot.kt). Hard-coded external-storage
    paths (/storage/emulated/0) were removed from the application logic.
  * Added a storage-volume picker, allowing the user to select separately the
    volume used for browsing and the volume used for the private vault.
  * Added a vault migration wizard (components/helpers/storage/VaultMigrator.kt):
    when the vault volume is changed, the whole locked folder tree is copied,
    verified and the old copy removed only after successful verification.
  * Additional user-interface strings were added in the nine supported
    languages.
  * Version numbers were changed to versionName 1.16 / versionCode 41.

2026-09-24
  * Added this NOTICE file: the GPLv3 section 5(a) statement of modification.
  * Removed the upstream F-Droid metadata (fdroid-metadata/) from this fork.
    It is inert here - F-Droid only reads the copy submitted to the fdroiddata
    repository - so it was deleted rather than edited.
  * Renamed the GitHub repository from muhan81/NekoVideo to muhan81/MistVD.

Later modifications are recorded in the project's change log. The application
display name and the launcher icon are also being changed to "MistVD". The
application ID (com.nkls.nekovideo) is intentionally kept UNCHANGED so that
users can upgrade over an existing installation.


